# GMS pulls and stuns everything it hits. Neither is modelled -- the fight has
# no positions to pull across and no state for a mob to be stunned in -- so
# what is left is a wide, hard swing, which is most of what the skill is.
name: "Spear Sweep"
description:
  "Swings your spear at everything in front of you at once, striking each "
  "of them four times over."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SPEARMAN
max_level: 20
base_delay_ms: 780
max_enemies: 8
lines: 4
base { skill_pct: 0.67 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.02 }
